// ---- recipes NestPrep publishes (recipes ADR-0001, ADR-0003) ----
// A catalogue, nobody's data: anybody signed in may read a recipe, and no
// client writes one — the catalogue seed does, as the Admin SDK. A recipe
// reaches a household only by being copied into its lunch library or its
// meals, where those rules check it. A list is bounded: the recipes view
// reads the published catalogue in one query of at most 200 (ADR-0003 §7).

match /recipes/{recipeId} {
  allow get: if isSignedIn();
  allow list: if isSignedIn() && request.query.limit <= 200;
  allow write: if false;
}
